            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>&quot;Tummyache&quot; is probably the most common complaint among children. It can be the result of too much candy, a virus, or a life-threatening gastrointestinal disorder. Symptoms of different conditions can mimic each other. Here's how to tell the difference.</AbstractText>
